  "blocks": {
    "\"Do a handoff. Write the decisions to a doc, clear, start the implementation in a fresh session reading from it.\"": "“做一次交接。把决策写进文档，清空当前会话，再开一个新会话读取该文档并开始实现。”",
    "\"Planning session is getting heavy — should I just keep going?\"": "“规划会话已经越来越臃肿了——还要继续在这里做吗？”",
    "The receiving session starts with zero context — the model is stateless, and nothing from the old session is visible to the new one. Whatever the next session needs has to be carried explicitly; everything else is gone. \"No return path\" is the constraint that shapes the carry: the new session can't ask the old one what it meant, so the carried material has to stand on its own.": "接收方会话从零上下文开始——<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model\">模型</a>是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/stateless\">无状态</a>的，旧会话中的任何内容都不会自动出现在新会话里。下一次会话所需的一切都必须明确传递，其他内容都会消失。“没有返回路径”是塑造交接内容的核心约束：新会话无法回头询问旧会话“这句话是什么意思”，因此传递的材料必须能够独立成立。",
    "The visible failure of a bad handoff is relitigation: the new session re-opens decisions the old one had settled, because the carry recorded what was decided but not why. Judge a handoff by what a session with zero context could do with it.": "糟糕交接最明显的失败表现是重新争论：新会话再次打开旧会话已经敲定的决策，因为交接材料只记录了决定是什么，却没有记录为什么这样决定。评价一次交接，应看一个零上下文会话仅凭这些材料能够做到什么。",
    "Transferring agent context from one session to another. The carry mechanism varies — a written handoff artifact, an in-memory summary (compaction), and others. Distinct from clearing (no transfer at all). Reasons vary: switching roles (planner → implementer), kicking off an AFK run, fanning out to parallel sessions, or freeing up context window room.": "交接是把<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>的<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context\">上下文</a>从一次<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/session\">会话</a>转移到另一次会话。承载方式可以不同，例如写入<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/handoff-artifact\">交接产物</a>、生成内存中的摘要（<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/compaction\">压缩</a>）等。它不同于<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/clearing\">清空</a>，后者完全不转移任何内容。进行交接的原因也很多：切换角色（规划者 → 实现者）、启动一次 <a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/afk\">AFK</a> 运行、展开多个并行会话，或释放<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>空间。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
